10:47.120 --> 10:48.720
Awak boleh buat keputusan begini.

10:50.280 --> 10:51.400
Hebatnya awak.

11:11.360 --> 11:12.080
Cik Ming.

11:13.680 --> 11:14.320
Maaf.

